    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Modern 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment available to rent on Aungier Street, Dublin 2. Fully furnished and suitable for up to 4 people.\nThe apartment features a private balcony and a bright, contemporary interior throughout. Partial utilities are included in the rent.\n\nLocated in the heart of Dublin 2, the apartment offers excellent access to South Great George's Street, Camden Street, Wexford Street, Grafton Street, and St Stephen's Green, all within easy walking distance. The area is well served by shops, cafés, restaurants, and public transport links, making it a convenient base for city living.\n\nRent: €2,350 per month. Parking available, optional. \n\nGet in touch to arrange a viewing."
      }
    ],
